eratorname{sec}⁡t,\\,t\\in [-\\pi ,\\pi ],\\,t\\ne \\pm \\frac{\\pi }{2}.\n$$\n\nTo restrict the parameterization to a quarter-hyperbola, we refer to the diagram below.\n\n![](/home/jake/Developer/Course_Academy/reference/mathacademy/question-capture/14062908/assets/ec38ac9d02fbc8ec8c4f79fccb36a0e91833e852127fd1a8c84e492276b8f95d.png)\n\nWe can see that if we restrict $t$ to $[-\\pi ,-\\frac{\\pi }{2})$ we get the required quarter-hyperbola.\n\nTherefore, the parametric equations that describe the required quarter-hyperbola are\n\n$$\nx=\\frac{1}{2}\\operatorname{tan}⁡t,\\,y=\\sqrt{7}\\operatorname{sec}⁡t,\\,t\\in [-\\pi ,-\\frac{\\pi }{2}).\n$$" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346415 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346416 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346417 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346418 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1000 #edb/ref 17592186346419 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1041 "selection" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1104 #edb/ref 17592186346415 13194139535371 true] [17592186346414 1110 #uuid "8fcd964d-0e31-56ad-b64e-f9ba5be6135d" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346415 1034 "t\\in [-\\pi ,-\\frac{\\pi }{2})" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346415 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535371 true] [17592186346415 1111 #uuid "c2501f99-90b6-5a90-9b00-d0a071839134" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346416 1034 "t\\in (-\\frac{\\pi }{2},0]" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346416 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535371 true] [17592186346416 1111 #uuid "215b54d5-ee02-5271-9669-ad4be828308d" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346417 1034 "t\\in (-\\pi ,0),\\,t\\ne -\\frac{\\pi }{2}" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346417 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139535371 true] [17592186346417 1111 #uuid "d7c9a6e1-ebf2-5344-9823-1907ded81afc" 13194139535371 true] [17592186346418 1034 "t\\